  "releaseNotes": "Prerelease: TemporalFormat annotations select one exact date/time format for CSV/XLSX text reads and CSV writes, using the configured culture. Native XLSX dates retain their existing rules. Complete dates and explicit offsets are validated; selected formats may omit precision. Includes custom converters, LINQ queries, and sync/async CSV creation, append, and insertion. BCL-only runtime and Native AOT support. API changes remain possible.",
